        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FP178, 1-7/8\" Round Solid Brass Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis round flush pull has a 1-7/8 inch diameter and a 1-1/8 inch inside finger hole. The 1-7/8 Inch Round Flush Pull looks simple; but don't let that deter you because it is available in 10 finishes so you can match almost any decor. Flush pulls like this one are ofter used on sliding pocket doors or barn doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FP178-specifications.gif?v=1704354521\" width=\"424\" height=\"241\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DEL-FP178 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/2-3-8-inch-diameter-round-flush-pull-deltana-fp238\">Deltana 2-3/8\" Round Flush Pull</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Solid Brass 1-7/8 Inch Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Dimeter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth:.444\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FP178-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262325\" target=\"new\"><b>DEL-FP178 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
